{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>A great and awesome El</b> — and He did not say 'mighty' (גבור) but mentioned 'great' corresponding to Abraham, concerning whom it is written: 'the great man' (האדם הגדול). And 'awesome' corresponding to Jacob, concerning whom it is written: 'how awesome is this place' (מה נורא המקום הזה). And He mentioned these, for we find that Abraham fought with the kings and Jacob against Laban and Esau, but we do not find that Isaac fought:"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:05.636942230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}